{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf1FqKc2cwf4d7aqEyqha","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! The implementation is complete and all tests pass. Here's what I've implemented:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. Added Error Code (`ApiError.kt`)\n- Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` error code for when a shipment cannot be confirmed due to its status\n\n### 2. Implemented Confirm Endpoint (`ShipmentController.kt`)\n- Added `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that:\n  - Returns **404** if shipment doesn't exist\n  - Moves a `CREATED` shipment to `CONFIRMED` and persists it\n  - Returns an already-`CONFIRMED` shipment unchanged (idempotent, safe for retries)\n  - Returns **409 Conflict** when trying to confirm a `CANCELLED` shipment\n\n### 3. Added Comprehensive Tests (`ShipmentControllerTest.kt`)\nFour new test cases covering all scenarios:\n- ✅ Confirms a created shipment moves it to confirmed status\n- ✅ Confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change (idempotency test)\n- ✅ Rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with 409 conflict\n- ✅ Rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404 not found\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Met\n\n✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` completes successfully  \n✅ **Existing tests pass** — All 5 original tests still pass; now 9 total for shipment tests  \n✅ **Endpoint confirms shipments** — `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` works correctly  \n✅ **Error responses consistent** — Uses existing `ApiException` framework (404 → `ResourceNotFoundException`, 409 → `ConflictException`)  \n✅ **Retry safety & state handling** — Repeated confirm succeeds, cancelled shipments rejected, unknown IDs rejected  \n✅ **No new dependencies** — Uses only existing Spring Boot and Kotlin libraries  \n✅ **Scoped changes** — Only modified shipment feature files (controller, tests) and the shared API error definitions  \n\nAll **17 tests pass** ✅